      "writtenOn": "2023-10-04T09:45:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "With Jabra Evolve2 75, you can trigger this by holding the Answer/End call button 2 secs (see \"7.12 Multiple call handling\" in headset documentation), you will hear 2 \"plops\".\n\nI.e. during \"Hook Switch\" test case step 1:\n- one press on Answer/End call button \u003d\u003e `release_active_accept_held_impl`\n- two press on Answer/End call button \u003d\u003e `release_held_impl`\n- 2 secs press on Answer/End call button \u003d\u003e `hold_active_accept_held_impl`",
      "parentUuid": "f332bc53_a3223ff9",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 2027,
